    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation + Plan note"/>
    <title>Assessment and Plan</title>
    <text><list listType="ordered"><item><content styleCode="Bold">Subsequent annual wellness visit completed</content>. Health risk assessment reviewed and the personalized prevention plan updated. Main risks are the fall on the stairs, now addressed, and cardiovascular risk, now treated. Cognitive screen and depression screen negative. [S]<list><item>Next annual wellness visit in one year.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">History of falling (Z91.81)</content>. One fall, on poorly lit stairs; Timed Up and Go 9 seconds; home changes made. [S]<list><item>No further falls-prevention exercise needed beyond his daily walks; review at each visit.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Acute viral conjunctivitis (B30.9)</content>. Resolved within a week. [S]<list><item>No further action.</item></list></item></list><paragraph>Personalized prevention plan. A written copy was given to the patient. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Influenza vaccine, this season</td><td>Completed today</td><td>High-dose vaccine given today</td></tr><tr><td>COVID-19 vaccine, this season</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Given today</td></tr><tr><td>Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PCV20 given today; no previous pneumococcal vaccine</td></tr><tr><td>Recombinant zoster vaccine</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Two-dose series completed four years ago</td></tr><tr><td>Tetanus booster</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Tdap five years ago</td></tr><tr><td>RSV vaccine</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>No chronic heart or lung disease or other condition that raises his risk; to be offered at 75</td></tr><tr><td>Depression screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PHQ-2 0</td></tr><tr><td>Cognitive assessment</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Mini-Cog 5 of 5; no concerns</td></tr><tr><td>Falls prevention</td><td>Completed today</td><td>One fall; Timed Up and Go 9 seconds; handrail and lighting added</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular risk</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Blood pressure 128/78 mmHg; on atorvastatin since August; lipids due at the next review</td></tr><tr><td>Colorectal cancer screening</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Colonoscopy six years ago, normal; next due in four years</td></tr><tr><td>Abdominal aortic aneurysm screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Recommended for men 65 to 75 who have ever smoked; he never has</td></tr><tr><td>Lung cancer screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Never smoker</td></tr><tr><td>Prostate cancer screening</td><td>Declined</td><td>Shared decision discussed; he declined PSA testing this year</td></tr><tr><td>Diabetes screening</td><td>Up to date</td><td>HbA1c 5.5 percent in August</td></tr><tr><td>Alcohol misuse screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>AUDIT-C 2</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis C and HIV screening</td><td>Up to date</td><td>One-time tests negative in his fifties</td></tr><tr><td>Hearing and vision</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Whispered-voice test passed; near vision normal with glasses</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Immunizations given today: High-dose influenza vaccine, 2026-2027 season; Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine PCV20; COVID-19 vaccine, 2026-2027 formula [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Guideline basis: Statin Use for the Primary Prevention of Cardiovascular Disease in Adults: Preventive Medication (2022); Falls Prevention in Community-Dwelling Older Adults: Interventions (2024); Medicare Wellness Visits (Medicare Learning Network) (2026); Medicare Preventive Services reference: visit templates, screening cascades, and documentation elements (2026); Adult Immunization Schedule by Age (2026); Expanded Recommendations for Use of Pneumococcal Conjugate Vaccines Among Adults Aged ≥50 Years: Recommendations of the Advisory Committee on Immunization Practices (2024); Colorectal Cancer: Screening (2021); Abdominal Aortic Aneurysm: Screening (2019); Prostate Cancer: Screening (2018)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Ulnar neuropathy and lipid review in three weeks as planned. Next annual wellness visit in one year. Next scheduled visit 2026-10-20: nine-week review of the ulnar neuropathy and lipids; shared decision on surgery. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
