<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He has never written a directive. He names a friend of many years as his health care agent and will complete the state form at his next visit. He wants full treatment for any illness he might recover from, including surgery on his elbow if it is advised. If he were dying, he would want to be kept comfortable at home rather than resuscitated or placed on a breathing machine. He asked that his drawings and papers be dealt with by his will, not by his medical directive. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>
